+
+mm68k-highword-opt
+Target Var(flag_m68k_highword_opt) Init(1) Optimization
+Enable the m68k high-word field access optimization pass.
+
+mm68k-reorder-mem
+Target Var(flag_m68k_reorder_mem) Init(1) Optimization
