+
+mm68k-btst-extract
+Target Var(flag_m68k_btst_extract) Init(1) Optimization
+Enable the btst+sne peephole for single-bit extraction on 68000/68010.
+
+mm68k-bitfield-xor
+Target Var(flag_m68k_bitfield_xor) Init(1) Optimization
